        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: TVPlayer, Amazon Fire TV\n- Organizations: Home (TV channel)\n- Concepts: live TV streaming, free-to-air channels, smart devices, video games, broadcast distribution\n\nFacts:\n- TVPlayer is a live TV streaming service that lets users watch free-to-air channels on desktops, smartphones, tablets, Apple TV 4th Generation, and Amazon Fire TV devices.\n- Amazon Fire TV allows users to play video games with the included remote, through a mobile app, or with an optional game controller.\n- Home is broadcast 24 hours a day on Sky, Virgin Media, and TVPlayer.",
